cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use NVS Runtime, please cite it as below."
title: "NVS Runtime"
type: software
version: 1.0.0
license: Apache-2.0
date-released: "2026-07-26"
url: "https://github.com/GemminAI/nvs-runtime"
repository-code: "https://github.com/GemminAI/nvs-runtime"
abstract: >-
  NVS Runtime is a provider-agnostic execution substrate for
  layer-oriented AI systems. Applications use a stable Runtime API;
  heterogeneous providers (MCP, HTTP, gRPC, Local, Kernel, HEKB) are
  orchestrated beneath it.
authors:
  - name: "GemminAI"
